WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.560
Episode 21

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.560
Deadly Challenge from the Domel Fleet <i>!!</i>

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.560
( Air date: Feb 23, 1975 )

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:40.300
Space Battleship

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:40.300
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:39.910
In 2200...

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:45.230
...the space battleship Yamato is 74,000 light years away from the Solar System.

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:50.470
{Iscandar}The planet, Balan,
the halfway point to Iscandar...

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:53.810
{Iscandar}...worked as a lighthouse
for the Yamato.

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:58.040
{JITSUWA} But it was a Gamilus supply
base for the invasion of Earth.

00:01:55.070 --> 00:02:00.560
Planet Balan

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:01.470
{taiyoukei}Admiral Domel, the commander of
the Solar System regional operation...

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:03.640
...attacked the Yamato
using his vicious plan...

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:06.120
Admiral Domel

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:06.120
{daibouryaku}...hoping Planet Balan
would become its graveyard.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:28.710
{shikashi}However, the Yamato narrowly
managed to hold off Domel's assault.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:56.390
{chikyuu}Gamilus put themselves in a tough situation
by destroying their own base on Balan.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:54.670
Planet Gamilus

00:02:56.390 --> 00:03:00.380
{touzen}Naturally, Domel, who commanded the
operation, had to take responsibility.

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:07.970
As I explained many times,
my mission planning was flawless.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:10.370
{SAKUSEN}The failure of the operation
and it's disastrous outcome...

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.710
{SAKUSEN}...was caused by a meaningless communication by my subordinate Gale.

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:18.570
Commander Domel, I informed Lord Desler,
because of my loyalty to him !

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:19.670
How could you...?

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:24.020
Gale, your excessive loyalty
caused the mission to fail.

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:27.020
{TATOE}Even if we lost the base, if we
managed to destroy the Yamato...

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:29.780
...our great objective
would have been achieved.

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:34.200
Commander Domel, you didn't think about
the risk of failure in your operation ?

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:36.370
My operations never fail.

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:38.800
If I didn't have to take the call
from Lord Desler at that time...

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:41.020
Don't be conceited !

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:46.500
The fact of the matter is that the Balan
base was lost, crippling our operations !

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:49.430
You have no excuse !
I propose capital punishment !

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:51.160
Execute him !

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:52.720
I think he has
to be executed !

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:53.470
Execute him !

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:55.840
Execute him !

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.780
I also support execution.

00:04:01.710 --> 00:04:03.620
We don't even need to
come up with a verdict.

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:10.930
The court orders the execution of Domel,
commander of the Earth Regional Operation.

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:21.200
What is it, Hisu ?

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:25.170
Sir, I've come to tell
you the verdict.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:27.130
Read it.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.300
It's unanimously agreed.

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:30.360
Agreed ?

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:37.390
It's capital punishment.
Please sign the order.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:40.330
Hisu.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:40.950
Yes, sir ?

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:43.010
This is my judgment.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:48.900
My Lord...

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:57.040
What he's done is unforgivable.  But if we
execute him, who will destroy the Yamato ?

00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:03.860
He was resolute. I don't think he'll back off
just because he failed in one operation...

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.100
Then you are...

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:06.270
Yes.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:10.470
I'm going to send Domel
to a decisive battle.

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:32.160
Domel.

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:37.110
The charge against you
was rejected by Lord Desler.

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:39.510
What ?  Rejected ?

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:48.240
Your new orders are to destroy the Yamato
before it enters the Large Magellanic Cloud.

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:58.370
Vice President Hisu, that's what I was
hoping for. I'll fight with all of my strength.

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:09.110
Meanwhile, aboard the
space battleship Yamato...

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:12.460
...the Gamilus materials obtained on Balan were undergoing a thorough analysis.

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:36.050
Sanada, have you found any clues about
where the Gamilusians come from ?

00:06:36.050 --> 00:06:41.430
This is still my hypothesis, but Gamilusians
might be planning to migrate to Earth.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.670
Look at this report.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:48.770
It shows traces of them reporting the progress
of contamination to their home planet.

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:54.570
If their objective was
to migrate to Earth...

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:57.180
...Planet Balan must have
been an important stronghold.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:01.490
But it was destroyed,
so they won't remain quiet.

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:02.620
You're right.

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:13.430
This is the
Galmarious Trinary.

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:16.060
No, the radioactive storm
is too strong there.

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:20.420
How about the gravitational
system of the Pozi planets ?

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:22.850
There's no space
for our fleet to hide.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:24.660
What's this ?

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:26.570
It's a luminous rainbow
colored cluster of planets...

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:28.290
...commonly known as
the Rainbow Star Cluster.

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:34.310
It's a mixed cluster of seven planets of
unique characteristics and dark gas.

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:36.460
Good. I've made
up my mind, Gale.

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:40.780
The Rainbow Cluster will be
the stage for our final battle.

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:43.320
It's the best location
to defeat that bastard.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:45.600
Gale...

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:46.330
Sir ?

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.970
Send my declaration of
challenge to the Yamato.

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:52.230
But Commander Domel, what
about our winning strategy ?

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:56.160
Don't worry. The plan is in
progress at the weapons factory.

00:07:58.070 --> 00:08:00.870
It's a newly developed
Instantaneous Material Transporter.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:03.300
Instantaneous Material Transporter ?

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:06.740
Yes. I've been envisaging
this concept for a long time.

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:18.620
It will generate a dimensional path, enabling
our fighters to make a surprise attack.

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:21.990
But the Yamato has an overwhelming
weapon, the Wave Motion Gun.

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:25.750
It's been taken
into account. Look.

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:30.200
What's that ?

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:31.260
A drill missile.

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:38.320
We'll fire this into the muzzle of the
Wave Motion Gun, then we'll finish it off.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:43.270
Gale, send my challenge
to the Yamato immediately...

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:45.640
...and inform each front line
about the final battle.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.770
Oh, you were
called in also, Yuki ?

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:55.710
Yes, I was.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.260
What happened, Kodai ?

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:05.390
Gamilus sent
us a challenge.

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:06.760
A challenge ?

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:09.510
The translator is set.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:12.800
Good.

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:13.670
Starting.

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:17.430
To the captain
of the Yamato...

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:21.060
It's time to settle
this once and for all.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:26.190
We desire Earth, just as much
as you want to go to Iscandar.

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:33.250
If you intend on going to Iscandar,
you must defeat us first in battle.

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:39.640
I propose to you an all out battle in the
Rainbow Star Cluster seven days from today.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:43.060
From the Commander of the Solar
System Regional Operation, Domel...

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.460
...to the captain
of the Yamato.

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:53.190
Captain, you'll
accept it, right ?

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:56.720
But Kodai, we haven't learned
enough about Gamilus yet.

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:58.640
Mr. Sanada,
what do you mean ?

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:02.130
It's disadvantageous
to fight head to head.

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:06.360
Do you mean we should run like cowards,
after being challenged like this ?

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:10.350
Kodai, our schedule
is very tight.

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:14.320
From a navigator's standpoint, I'd say
we should avoid unnecessary combat.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:16.620
Then, let me speak
as the Sub-Captain.

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:19.570
A decisive battle means,
winning or losing.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:23.230
If we lose, everything is over,
but if we win, our path will be clear.

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:28.160
Hey guys, the Captain is here.
Let him decide.

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:34.920
I'll accept his challenge.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:38.020
We'll have to face this
ordeal someday anyway.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:42.130
We must win and open
the way to Iscandar.

00:11:56.560 --> 00:12:01.160
Carrier 1

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:13.060
Preparing for landing.
Speed, 006...005...

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:13.060
Squadron leader of Carrier 1: Getto

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:18.060
Carrier 2

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:22.060
Squadron leader of Carrier 2: Barger

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:22.060
We're landing. We'll be able to walk
on our homeland's soil after so long.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:30.060
Carrier 3

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:38.310
Carrier 1 and
Carrier 2 have landed.

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:41.010
Squadron leader of Carrier 3: Kloiz

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:41.010
Very well.  Carrier 3
will land at point three.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:57.290
It's a magnificent view to see
Carriers 1, 2 and 3 all lined up.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.990
Alright, land the
Battle Carrier next to them.

00:12:59.990 --> 00:13:00.700
Aye, sir.

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:05.060
Squadron Leader of the Battle Carrier: Hidern

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:04.610
We're going to have a
major battle after so long.

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:10.800
Battle Carrier

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:16.420
Commander Domel, all carrier
air groups have arrived.

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:17.160
I see.

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:26.250
Everyone, I appreciate
all of you for coming.

00:13:27.670 --> 00:13:30.490
I'm Getto from
the Ruby Theater.

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:34.920
I'm Barger from
the Sapphire Theater

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:38.790
I'm Kloiz from
the Diamond Theater.

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:43.820
I'm Hidern from
the Omega Theater.

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:49.160
Thank you for coming. We'll move out
tomorrow morning, so sleep well tonight.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:51.000
Aye, sir.

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:12.430
Hey guys, make sure you maintain them
thoroughly, so that they won't hate you.

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:13.540
Alright.

00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:15.810
Working hard ?
Good. Good.

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:20.400
Everyone's working hard, Dr. Sado.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:24.670
You're annoying.
Why don't you be quiet ?

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:27.130
You're always laid back,
no matter what.

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:30.710
If I respond to everything,
I'd be worn out.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:33.910
Why don't you have some ?

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:37.570
Thanks. For some reason,
I can't sit still.

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:42.160
Not bad.

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:46.020
One more.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:49.130
You're a good companion.

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:57.180
What kind of place is
that Rainbow Star Cluster ?

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:02.970
That's an estimated sketch.

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:04.640
They're spectral planets.

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:06.810
Each planet is illuminated
in its spectral color...

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:09.810
...based on the temperature of each
component, such as kalium and natrium.

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:14.370
In addition, there is a black band of gas,
and there are many dark planets.

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:18.020
I see.
The gas will be a problem.

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:22.820
If we enter carelessly, our radar will be
useless, and we'll have to depend on our eyes.

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:24.560
What's the matter...?

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:28.180
What's the matter with real combat ?
Don't be chickening out.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:34.710
Analyzer, everyone's serious.
You're being rude.

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:37.920
What's the matter
with Gamilus ?

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:41.800
I'll blow them
away with my snort.

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:47.780
You're so easygoing.

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:56.760
Long live my Lord.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:15:59.870
Long live my Lord.

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.460
Long live my Lord. {OMITTED THE REST}

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:21.730
Everyone, it is time to fight the Yamato
to decide the future of Gamilus.

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:27.670
We'll entrust our fate to Admiral Domel
and his skilled subordinates.

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:31.370
I look forward to your
victorious return. Fight well.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:46.330
We're heading out.
Do your best.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.130
Everyone, get onboard.

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:55.020
Commander Domel,
let me ask you.

00:16:55.020 --> 00:16:57.710
What if the drill missile
can't finish it off...?

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:04.720
When the time comes, our loyalty
to Lord Desler will be our weapon.

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:07.330
Loyalty to Lord Desler ?

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:10.360
When it comes to loyalty,
you exceed me.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.450
All ships, launch immediately.

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:43.210
Carrier 1

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:47.260
Carrier 2

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:51.210
Carrier 3

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:54.260
Battle Carrier

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:13.530
Domel Fleet Flagship

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:37.470
Solar System Sector
Commander Domel...

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:39.250
What kind of
man is he ?

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:44.750
He will be sent to determine the future
of their homeland. It won't be easy.

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:59.280
We'll wait for the Yamato
just outside this black band.

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:03.620
The Yamato's radar will be jammed by the
Rainbow Star Cluster's magnetic waves.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:07.020
{DAIICHI}The first wave will physically
destroy the Yamato's radar.

00:19:07.020 --> 00:19:09.350
Then it will
be all ours.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:17.480
{YAMATO}It won't be able to detect us, and the Wave
Motion Gun will be sealed by our drill missile.

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:21.920
{SOSHITE}And it will be
destroyed from the inside.

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:26.930
I see. It's just like you, Commander Domel.
The Yamato won't be able to even touch us.

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:28.910
But we shouldn't
drop our guard.

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:33.460
The captain of the Yamato, Okita,
is no common sort of a man.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:38.600
Captain, we're almost at
the Rainbow Star Cluster.

00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:41.060
Good. Switch to
automatic cruising.

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:42.310
Aye, sir.

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:47.880
Mori, assemble the crew
in the observatory room.

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:48.260
Aye, sir.

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:56.320
I wonder how they're
going to come at us.

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:58.970
This's a great chance
to destroy them all at once.

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:03.180
Kodai, I feel like we shouldn't
have responded to their provocation.

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.200
Do you mean
we should run ?

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:08.370
We'll have to face
them someday anyway.

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:10.480
If so, we should get rid
of them as soon as possible.

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:12.740
But what if we lose ?

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:13.970
Quiet, the Captain's here.

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:22.840
Everyone, a crucial battle
against the Domel Fleet is near.

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:27.240
{CHOSENJO}Judging from their challenge, they will
be coming with strong determination.

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:35.420
{WAREWARE}We have to do our best to win for the sake
of our homeland and to bring peace in space.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:39.460
{DAGA}Obviously, the outcome can't
be determined until we fight.

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:46.260
{SOKODE}I'd like to exchange
farewell cups of water.

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:56.610
{SHIKASHI}This isn't meant
to prepare for death.

00:20:56.610 --> 00:21:03.790
{IIKA}Listen everyone, this is our promise to win
the battle, and then we'll declare our victory.

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.370
Alright !

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:08.570
Good luck.

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:20.480
Commander Domel, it's the Yamato !
The Yamato has arrived !

00:21:24.570 --> 00:21:26.160
The rat is
entering the trap.

00:21:38.490 --> 00:21:39.880
The radar is jammed.

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:43.130
All hands, battle stations.

00:21:43.550 --> 00:21:45.160
All hands, battle stations.

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:57.420
I expect everyone to perform
well for the future of mankind.

00:22:25.120 --> 00:22:26.760
All hands, battle stations.

00:22:27.880 --> 00:22:29.360
All hands, battle stations.

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:19.920
Between the beautifully
illuminated planets...

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:23.570
{IMA}...the space battleship
Yamato and the Domel fleet...

00:23:23.570 --> 00:23:26.130
{IMA}...are about to engage in combat for
the future of each of their homelands.

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:29.670
Yamato, people are
waiting for your return.

00:23:29.670 --> 00:23:32.670
Mankind will be
extinct in 215 days.

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:35.410
215 days left until the destruction of Earth

00:23:32.670 --> 00:23:34.550
Only 215 days left.

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:43.090
Okita Juzo:

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:43.090
Naya Goro

00:23:43.380 --> 00:23:48.600
Desler:

00:23:43.380 --> 00:23:48.600
Ibu Masayuki

00:23:48.880 --> 00:23:54.100
Hisu:

00:23:48.880 --> 00:23:54.100
Yamashita Keisuke

00:23:56.520 --> 00:24:06.020
Note:
Only this episode was commissioned to Sunrise Studio, including animation, animation direction, arrange, scheduling and painting.

